      "solution": "<p><strong>Given Word:</strong>&nbsp;CONSERVATION</p>\n\n<p>1)&nbsp;VAIN&nbsp;&rarr; Can be formed</p>\n\n<p>2)&nbsp;<strong>C</strong>A<strong>U</strong>TION&nbsp;&rarr; Cannot be formed (Because in the given word there is no <strong>&#39;U&#39;</strong>)</p>\n\n<p>3)&nbsp;ACTOR&nbsp;&rarr; Can be formed</p>\n\n<p>4)&nbsp;STAIN&nbsp;&rarr; Can be formed</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;Option 2&quot;</strong>.</p>\n",
