    {
      "id": "979b0a574dd6-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "7 males A, B, C, D, E, F and G are sitting in a row facing north (not necessarily in the same order). Only four males are to the left of A. B is the immediate neighbour of A and C. D is third to the left of E. F is not the immediate neighbour of E. Who is sitting between D and G?",
      "questionHtml": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">7 males A, B, C, D, E, F and G are sitting in a row facing north (not necessarily in the same order). Only four males are to the left of A. B is the immediate neighbour of A and C. D is third to the left of E. F is not the immediate neighbour of E. Who is sitting between D and G?</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "B",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">B</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "E",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">E</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "F",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">F</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "A",
          "html": "<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">A</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">7 males A, B, C, D, E, F and G are sitting in a row facing north&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Only four males are to the left of A</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">B is the immediate neighbour of A and C.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">D is third to the left of E.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">F is not the immediate neighbour of E.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6a29aa5d24d03d33fafd4c00.png\" style=\"height: 103px; width: 350px;\" /></p>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p>According to the table, D is at position 1 and G is at position 3.</p>\n\n<p>The person sitting between D and G is F (at position 2).</p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the male sitting between D and G is <strong>F</strong>.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage6a29aa5d24d03d33fafd4c00.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
