    {
      "id": "979b0a574dd6-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "What comes next in the series? \\( 144, 121, 100, 81, ? \\)",
      "questionHtml": "What comes next in the series?<br />\n<br />\n<span class=\"math-tex\">\\( 144, 121, 100, 81, ? \\)</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "49",
          "html": "49"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "64",
          "html": "64"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "60",
          "html": "60"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "36",
          "html": "36"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Logic followed here is,</p>\n\n<p>(12)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 144</p>\n\n<p>(11)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 121</p>\n\n<p>(10)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 100</p>\n\n<p>9<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 81</p>\n\n<p><strong>8<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 64</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is &ldquo;<b>Option 2</b>&rdquo;.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "979b0a574dd6-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "What comes next? AG, BH, CI, ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>What comes next?</p>\n\n<p>AG, BH, CI, ?</p>\n",
      "options": [
