        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "FL",
          "html": "FL"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "GM",
          "html": "GM"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">First letters: A, B, C → increasing by 1 → Next = D<br />\nSecond letters: G, H, I → increasing by 1 → Next = J</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">D + J = DJ</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Hence, the correct answer is <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Option 1</span>.</span></p>\n",
