          "html": "<p>17</p>\n"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The middle candle is 8th from both ends.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, there are 7 candles on the left of the middle candle and 7 candles on the right of the middle candle.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Total number of candles = 7+1+7 = 15</p>\n",
