      "id": "979b0a574dd6-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "If we increase each even digit by '1' and decrease each odd digit by '1' in the number '7846921453' and then arrange all the number in descending order, then what is the sum of the first five digits from the left end after the rearrangement?",
      "questionHtml": "If we increase each even digit by &#39;1&#39; and decrease each odd digit by &#39;1&#39; in the number &#39;7846921453&#39; and then arrange all the number in descending order, then what is the sum of the first five digits from the left end after the rearrangement?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "35",
          "html": "35"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "32",
          "html": "32"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "38",
          "html": "38"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "34",
          "html": "34"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Increase each even digit by 1.</span><br style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\" />\n<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Decrease each odd digit by 1.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Arrange in descending order</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">9, 8, 7, 6, 5, 5, 4, 3, 2, 0</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Take the first five digits from the left end</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">9, 8, 7, 6, 5</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">sum = </span>9 + 8 + 7 + 6 + 5 = 35</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "979b0a574dd6-q11",
      "number": 11,
      "question": "In this type of questions, question is provided with substitutes for various mathematical symbols, followed by a question involving calculation of an expression or choosing the correct/incorrect equation. You have to put the real signs in the given equation and then solve the questions as required. If '^' stands for '&divide;', '@' stands for '+', '%' stands for '-', '$' stands for 'x', then find the value of: 8 % 11 $ 10 % 3 = ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>In this type of questions, question is provided with substitutes for various mathematical symbols, followed by a question involving calculation of an expression or choosing the correct/incorrect equation. You have to put the real signs in the given equation and then solve the questions as required.</p>\n\n<p>If &#39;^&#39; stands for &#39;&divide;&#39;, &#39;@&#39; stands for &#39;+&#39;, &#39;%&#39; stands for &#39;-&#39;, &#39;$&#39; stands for &#39;x&#39;, then find the value of:</p>\n\n<p>8 % 11 $ 10 % 3 = ?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "-106",
          "html": "-106"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "-104",
          "html": "-104"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "-33",
          "html": "-33"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "-105",
          "html": "-105"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 200px;\">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Alphabet</th>\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">^</th>\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">@</th>\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">%</th>\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">$</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Meaning</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">÷</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">+</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">-</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">×</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 8 - <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">11 <span style=\"text-align: center;\">×</span> 10</span></u> - 3 = ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 8 <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">- 110 - 3</span></u> = ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ <u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">8 - 113</span></u> = <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">-105</span>.</p>\n",
